{
    "title": "Chat&Yamo : dating app",
    "description": "Welcome to Chat&Yamo, the app designed by people like you for you\u2026 and the rest of the world. Did you imagine better features to help you improve your dating experience? We got some here you can check. And guess what? Still many more to come.\r\n\r\nDid you know it\u2019s possible to reach out and tell us about other perfect features you\u2019ve imagined from your past dating nightmares? Cool, right? We thoughtfully build our app around you. Why would it be otherwise? \r\n\r\nEnjoy Chat&Yamo. Chat and adore It.\r\nMeet singles around you or in your dream country. It\u2019s free, so come and meet without spending a dime, or get a Premium membership for more features.\r\n\r\nAs you begin contemplating your journey with Chat&Yamo, and because your needs count, these are some of the features you can get the best out from:\r\n\r\n< Find People in your country or from Your Diaspora: In your parameters we make it easier if you are looking to find singles from a certain origin. So come and fulfill that crush appetite.\r\n\r\n< Match with Others by dating intents: Like or send likes to others singles with the same intent as you. This saves you time for better connections and less frustration. The categories are: \r\n-\tMarriage\r\n-\tLong-lasting love\r\n-\tFlirt\r\n-\tFriendship\r\n-\tLet\u2019s Find Out\r\n\r\n< Custom Search: Set your search criteria in your parameters and get proposals of singles from a specific country, or set another country and get potential matches in that country. All in a matter of seconds.\r\n\r\n< Spot Singles Around You: With Singles Met, you are notified when you come across any singles on the street using the app. This allows you two to fasten the process, engage in a conversation and get to know each other around a drink right away if you like.\r\n\r\n< Video Chat: Get a more advanced experience by switching from chat to video call. In-app video calls allow a more immersive experience where you and your match can elaborate more on your needs, your expectations, before actually exchanging numbers.\r\n\r\n< Customer Service/ Support: In-app support, and customer service are available to any newbie users to dating apps. We will help you navigate these waters.\r\n\r\n< Dating Coaches & in-person events: You don\u2019t know where to start from your ex or your past experience? You lack experience talking to singles of the other sex? Get in one of their sessions with our coaches, they got you covered. \r\n\r\nSo when do you want to go on a date?\r\n\r\nDownload Chat&Yamo for free today, and you'll be well on your way to building thoughtful connections.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to Chat&amp;Yamo, the app designed by people like you for you\u2026 and the rest of the world. Did you imagine better features to help you improve your dating experience? We got some here you can check. And guess what? Still many more to come.<br><br>Did you know it\u2019s possible to reach out and tell us about other perfect features you\u2019ve imagined from your past dating nightmares? Cool, right? We thoughtfully build our app around you. Why would it be otherwise? <br><br>Enjoy Chat&amp;Yamo. Chat and adore It.<br>Meet singles around you or in your dream country. It\u2019s free, so come and meet without spending a dime, or get a Premium membership for more features.<br><br>As you begin contemplating your journey with Chat&amp;Yamo, and because your needs count, these are some of the features you can get the best out from:<br><br>&lt; Find People in your country or from Your Diaspora: In your parameters we make it easier if you are looking to find singles from a certain origin. So come and fulfill that crush appetite.<br><br>&lt; Match with Others by dating intents: Like or send likes to others singles with the same intent as you. This saves you time for better connections and less frustration. The categories are: <br>-\tMarriage<br>-\tLong-lasting love<br>-\tFlirt<br>-\tFriendship<br>-\tLet\u2019s Find Out<br><br>&lt; Custom Search: Set your search criteria in your parameters and get proposals of singles from a specific country, or set another country and get potential matches in that country. All in a matter of seconds.<br><br>&lt; Spot Singles Around You: With Singles Met, you are notified when you come across any singles on the street using the app. This allows you two to fasten the process, engage in a conversation and get to know each other around a drink right away if you like.<br><br>&lt; Video Chat: Get a more advanced experience by switching from chat to video call. In-app video calls allow a more immersive experience where you and your match can elaborate more on your needs, your expectations, before actually exchanging numbers.<br><br>&lt; Customer Service/ Support: In-app support, and customer service are available to any newbie users to dating apps. We will help you navigate these waters.<br><br>&lt; Dating Coaches &amp; in-person events: You don\u2019t know where to start from your ex or your past experience? You lack experience talking to singles of the other sex? Get in one of their sessions with our coaches, they got you covered. <br><br>So when do you want to go on a date?<br><br>Download Chat&amp;Yamo for free today, and you&#39;ll be well on your way to building thoughtful connections.",
